%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3d3e5f8e5114244eb1eb6e5fe76e2d4, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 138154721280
    m_Localized: Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332084827242496
    m_Localized: E to advance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332172047794176
    m_Localized: Hello Kami.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332260396613632
    m_Localized: Welcome to my library. There's a lot of books for you to read here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332300250890240
    m_Localized: Shall we start?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332305120477184
    m_Localized: 'Very well. Our first book is called ''Kami Paper Scissors''. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332307267960832
    m_Localized: 'Have you heard of it? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332309033762816
    m_Localized: Of course you have! This is your book! Can you remember how it starts?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344823507304448
    m_Localized: <i>Narrator</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347727467233280
    m_Localized: To be continued...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656639550668800
    m_Localized: Gino
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655372984107008
    m_Localized: '[Kami finds Grandma frightened and hiding in the bushes.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 654981567463424
    m_Localized: Dalia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655004556443648
    m_Localized: Tiburcio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655045119557632
    m_Localized: Grandma
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656247265804288
    m_Localized: Thank you for carrying me. Come on, let's eat the choripanes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661833231482880
    m_Localized: '[The girls enjoy the choripanes.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661836435931136
    m_Localized: '[The gigantic hand of the narrator descends from the sky.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661838587609088
    m_Localized: What have you done!? You are coming with me this instant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661841552982016
    m_Localized: You can't just walk around, changing the story as you please! Grandma
      was never supposed to leave that page...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661840252747776
    m_Localized: Who told you to make origamis out of the other characters? Or that
      you could upgrade you scissors?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661842916130816
    m_Localized: 'I''m going to take you to another book,

      "Kami, Ink and Punishment".
      This should teach you a lesson...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661653480390656
    m_Localized: Thanks for the help, Kami! The chickens are happy back at the ranch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661576607186944
    m_Localized: Thanks! Look, the chickens are already crossing the tree. Here,
      take this as reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661588523204608
    m_Localized: '[You can now walk on the water!]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661548048171008
    m_Localized: I need you to cut that tree!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661432029528064
    m_Localized: Kami! Please help me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661435837956096
    m_Localized: My chickens are trapped on the other side of the river! I need you
      to cut that tree so it falls and makes a bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661449255534592
    m_Localized: You don't happen to have scissors on you, do ya?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661274998980608
    m_Localized: Tell Grandma the choripanes are 'bout to be ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660504731828224
    m_Localized: '[Press E to unfold Grandma.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660498415206400
    m_Localized: Could you find Grandma? Where is she?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660496028647424
    m_Localized: '[Kami receives her Skimming Shoes. Hold down SHIFT to run faster!]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660494095073280
    m_Localized: You came back for the Skimming Shoes, right? You left them here.
      You'll be able to skim through the book with them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660424608038912
    m_Localized: 'Go fetch Grandma, we''re about to eat! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660091592884224
    m_Localized: Take the scissors with you, they're by the shed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660089567035392
    m_Localized: Could you go fetch her? I'm 'boutta get the choripanes on the grill,
      she's gonna miss lunch again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660088149360640
    m_Localized: Grandma's gone missing again. She went for her daily stroll this
      morning and hasn't come back since.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 660063197446144
    m_Localized: Kami, Kami! You gotta help me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 658716536455168
    m_Localized: Thank you for the flowers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657928351236096
    m_Localized: '[Kami receives 50 papers from Dalia.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657926950338560
    m_Localized: Because you've been sooo nice to me I'm going to give you some paper!
      I know you are super skilled with it so I hope you find it useful!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657925180342272
    m_Localized: Thank you so much for picking up the flowers for me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657748046495744
    m_Localized: 'The flowers are like the ones right there! Could you please bring
      3 of them to me? Pretty please? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657290133356544
    m_Localized: They are purple and quite large, but I can't leave my post to go
      pick them up! Could you please bring  me 3 of them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657288740847616
    m_Localized: There's these very special potions I'm preparing and I need flowers
      to make them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657286689832960
    m_Localized: 'You know, I kind of need your help with something... '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657248433586176
    m_Localized: Morning Kami!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657144913969152
    m_Localized: I hope you like your upgraded scissors!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657081387040768
    m_Localized: 'There ya go. Now you''ll be able to cut through some rocks with
      them! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 657038307344384
    m_Localized: Great! Now pass me your scissors! It will be one second...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656879393554432
    m_Localized: Could you do me a favor and get 100 papers for me? Don't sweat it
      though, you can come back to this page anytime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656803698950144
    m_Localized: I'm having trouble getting the oven to fire up. It's so windy today...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656721972936704
    m_Localized: Hey! Look who's here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656360126136320
    m_Localized: '[THIS IS THE END OF THIS BOOK]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656294703382528
    m_Localized: Now have you seen the salt shaker? Norberto keeps hiding it, he
      says it's better for my health or something...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656153699270656
    m_Localized: '[Press E to fold Grandma.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 656053900001280
    m_Localized: And darling, my back hurts. Could you fold me and take me with you
      in your bag?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655892767424512
    m_Localized: Thank you for saving me Kami, that was amazing! Now let's get outta
      here, I'm starving!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655586474180608
    m_Localized: Why don't you cut open the dam and give it a nice splash?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655541179891712
    m_Localized: 'And there''s a huge rock monster ahead! We''re lucky it''s sleeping. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655499480121344
    m_Localized: Kami! Thank god you're here! I fell down the cliff and I couldn't
      go back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 654939758641152
    m_Localized: Uncle Norberto
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000000
    m_Localized: Natalia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000196
    m_Localized: "Narrator"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000197
    m_Localized: "???"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000001
    m_Localized: "[Kami runs into a girl with a worried look on her face.]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000002
    m_Localized: "...between Ariel never leaving me alone, the museum robberies, and this caf\xE9 being so expensive, I don't know what I'm going to do. I'm so fed up-"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000003
    m_Localized: "Oh, sorry, I didn't see you there. What do you need?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000004
    m_Localized: "[...]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000005
    m_Localized: "So they brought you here from another book? No wonder your ink looks so different!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000006
    m_Localized: "My name is Natalia, I'm a private detective. I was just having a coffee while trying to solve a case."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000190
    m_Localized: "There's been a string of robberies at the museum, and nobody can find the thief."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000191
    m_Localized: "...breaking news: another incident at the city museum! An original Pelusa has reportedly been stolen, valued at 20 million dollars..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000192
    m_Localized: "Another one? Right now?! That artist's works are worth a fortune, we have to go and investigate right away!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000193
    m_Localized: "Tell you what: help me solve this case, and I'll help you get back to your book."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000194
    m_Localized: "Oh, but first: could you hang on to the receipt from the purchase? It might come in handy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000125
    m_Localized: "What about the receipt? Fold it up, it might come in handy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000195
    m_Localized: "Alright! Let's go to the museum and look for clues!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000198
    m_Localized: "You can't go through. Our officers are investigating the scene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000199
    m_Localized: "Although they haven't found anything yet..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000100
    m_Localized: "[Kami finds a clue inside the trash can.]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000200
    m_Localized: "Look, Kami, it looks like the thief tried to ditch their gloves..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000201
    m_Localized: "But they only tossed one. Let's keep looking for more clues."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000101
    m_Localized: "[Kami finds a clue hooked on a car's windshield wiper.]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000202
    m_Localized: "Look, Kami, it looks like the thief lost their hat!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000203
    m_Localized: "This thief is pretty absent-minded."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000103
    m_Localized: "The cops guarding the entrance are gone. This is our chance to sneak into the museum!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000102
    m_Localized: "[Kami finds a clue on the floor, surrounded by broken glass.]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000204
    m_Localized: "Look, Kami, it looks like the thief dropped their watch on the floor and it broke."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000205
    m_Localized: "Time of the robbery: 20:30."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000105
    m_Localized: "Time's up for the thief! Let's take these three clues to my place so we can analyze them and unravel this mystery."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000107
    m_Localized: "A giant gift... at my door? What is this?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000108
    m_Localized: "Cut the ribbon and let's see what it is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000109
    m_Localized: "Cut the ribbon and let's see what this mysterious gift is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000110
    m_Localized: "Ariel"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000111
    m_Localized: "Police"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000112
    m_Localized: "Kami, I can't believe it, it's the original Pelusa! Did the thief bring this here?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000113
    m_Localized: "We have to take it back to the museum, but..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000114
    m_Localized: "Look! There's a letter inside, can you read what it says?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000115
    m_Localized: "Police! Hands up!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000116
    m_Localized: "There they are, the thieves. Arrest them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000117
    m_Localized: "Ariel, what are you doing? Can you stop bothering me?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000120
    m_Localized: "We didn't steal anything. What is this tasteless joke?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000119
    m_Localized: "Here's a letter! It says... blah blah blah... blah blah blah... \"this is your cut of the robbery\"."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000118
    m_Localized: "Well, it's pretty clear they're guilty."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000206
    m_Localized: "No! Stop! We've been framed!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000186
    m_Localized: "You two are staying locked up in here forever! Damn liars!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000207
    m_Localized: "And don't even think about escaping. If I catch you, I'll kick you right back into your cell!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000187
    m_Localized: "Shut up! We're not damn liars!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000208
    m_Localized: "Kami, we have to find a way out!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000123
    m_Localized: "[Kami can't find any way out, and all seems lost...]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000209
    m_Localized: "[But suddenly, a strong tremor shakes the police station.]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000121
    m_Localized: "Surpriiise! Oh, you won't believe what happened to me!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000122
    m_Localized: "What was that noise?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000210
    m_Localized: "Well, I'll tell you later. Let's grab our things and get out of here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000188
    m_Localized: "Thanks for saving me, Kami! Hi! Is this your grandma who got lost too?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000211
    m_Localized: "Well, you can tell us later. Right now we have to escape through that window up there. But how do we get up there?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000212
    m_Localized: "Incredible! I didn't know you were an origami expert."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000213
    m_Localized: "Let's get back to the museum, quickly!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000124
    m_Localized: Grace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000130
    m_Localized: I'm Grace, director of this museum. Without proof, I'm afraid I
      can't believe a word you say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000134
    m_Localized: Well? Let's see that ticket of yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000144
    m_Localized: The catapult is ready whenever you are. Don't forget to say goodbye
      to Natalia!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000189
    m_Localized: "[Kami and the girls arrive at the museum, where the police and Ariel are questioning a girl.]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000214
    m_Localized: "...and it must have been around eight thirty."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000215
    m_Localized: "Ladies, what do you want now? The museum is closed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000151
    m_Localized: "There are the fugitives, still holding the Pelusa!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000152
    m_Localized: "Nobody move! You two are going straight back to your cells!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000153
    m_Localized: "Girls, what did you do now?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000154
    m_Localized: "Grandma!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000155
    m_Localized: "Wait, officers. If these girls stole the Pelusa, why would they bring it back?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000216
    m_Localized: "I'm Grace, the director of the museum. What do you have to say?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000217
    m_Localized: "We didn't steal the Pelusa! We were framed to make us look like the thieves, but it wasn't us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000218
    m_Localized: "Nobody believes you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000219
    m_Localized: "I can prove it, look!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000220
    m_Localized: "Kami, show them the caf\xE9 ticket."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000232
    m_Localized: "Whoa! What a rip-off!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000172
    m_Localized: "See? It says 20:30! At the time of the robbery we were at the caf\xE9! There is no way it was us!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000173
    m_Localized: "That proves nothing. That ticket could be fake."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000174
    m_Localized: "No! Stop bothering me! Besides, look at this!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000175
    m_Localized: "We found Ariel's hat and one of his gloves at the scene of the robbery. And he happens to be missing a hat and a glove."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000176
    m_Localized: "And we also found your watch! With the time it stopped at: 20:30."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000177
    m_Localized: "Incredible... Besides, Ariel, your father is the museum's biggest benefactor. You surely used his keys to get into the Pelusa's room."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000178
    m_Localized: "Hmm, it all adds up. That explains the other robberies too. Ladies, I think we owe you an apology."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000179
    m_Localized: "You, Ariel, will have to come with us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000180
    m_Localized: "No, you're crazy! You don't know what you're saying!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000181
    m_Localized: "You are a terrible person, Ariel. Why did you want me to take the blame?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000221
    m_Localized: "I'm not going to tell you..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000222
    m_Localized: "..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000223
    m_Localized: "..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000224
    m_Localized: "..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000225
    m_Localized: "..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000226
    m_Localized: "It's just that I was afraid a good detective like you would find out about my robberies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000227
    m_Localized: "And everything would have gone fine if it weren't for that girl with the scissors!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000228
    m_Localized: "Alright, that's enough, move along, sir, please."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000182
    m_Localized: "Great work, girls. The Pelusa is back home thanks to you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000183
    m_Localized: "There's one more thing, Grace. Kami isn't from here, she has to get back to her book."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000184
    m_Localized: "Hmm..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000185
    m_Localized: "If you're not afraid, you could use the old catapult."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000229
    m_Localized: "I'm not afraid."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000230
    m_Localized: "Great, then! When you're ready to leave, climb onto the catapult."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000231
    m_Localized: "Don't forget to say goodbye to Natalia before you go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000145
    m_Localized: "So this is what solving a case with a partner is like. Much better than doing it alone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000146
    m_Localized: "Thanks for your help, Kami. I hope we see each other again soon."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000147
    m_Localized: "When you're ready, cut the rope, dear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000148
    m_Localized: Kami and her grandmother soared over the rooftops of the newspaper,
      straight toward the fold of their own book...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000149
    m_Localized: '...until they crashed into something big, round and blue: the lamp
      on the Narrator''s desk.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000150
    m_Localized: Knocked off course, they tumbled between the pages of a book they
      had never read.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 661900000000169
    m_Localized: "RADIO"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
